{"ID":"20260620203709-772zdu3","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260620203709-772zdu3","title":"美术资源需求","type":"doc","updated":"20260626180224"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260620203727-h75od75","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260620203727-h75od75","updated":"20260621202754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"UI图标"}]},{"ID":"20260621201801-4fk7w4w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260621201801-4fk7w4w","updated":"20260625023335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刚进入游戏要求电脑与门相对位置时的俯视图美术素材"}]},{"ID":"20260625023335-6e4heun","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260625023335-6e4heun","updated":"20260626171737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"B游戏流程的3D资产"}]},{"ID":"20260625023352-6g35w0a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260625023352-6g35w0a","updated":"20260625032337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要色调在黄昏阶段多使用暖黄（但不要太暖，可以降点饱和度），在入夜后使用暗色调，整体加一个偏灰蓝滤镜，显得阴暗"}]},{"ID":"20260626171733-ykp2288","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626171733-ykp2288","updated":"20260626171737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"具体资产你俩自己找吧（"}]},{"ID":"20260621202736-gc2qi1c","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260621202736-gc2qi1c","updated":"20260626180224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"A游戏流程的2D背景"}]},{"ID":"20260625023314-8cd0383","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260625023314-8cd0383","updated":"20260625032322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以红黑色为主色调，尽可能显得压抑"}]},{"ID":"20260626174851-ohilikg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626174851-ohilikg","updated":"20260626174905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"整体任务和背景关系的处理参考《烟火》"}]},{"ID":"20260626172346-y9g7wp6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260626172346-y9g7wp6","updated":"20260626180224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"场景背景图"}]},{"ID":"20260626171746-vholsb1","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260626171746-vholsb1","updated":"20260626172341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260626172341-6wmc9wt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260626172341-6wmc9wt","updated":"20260626172341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260626172341-a455gi6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626172341-a455gi6","updated":"20260626172341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有点破败、沿途有好几个垃圾桶的美国街巷，比较长"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260626171708-vqm2kql","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260626171708-vqm2kql","updated":"20260626180224"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260626171752-sbptd57","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260626171752-sbptd57","updated":"20260626171752"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260626171752-t73xfoa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626171752-t73xfoa","updated":"20260626171759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"学校食堂，背景里还有不少在吃饭的人影"}]}]},{"ID":"20260626171808-ykzfrwm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260626171808-ykzfrwm","updated":"20260626171808"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260626171808-2yd3u0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626171808-2yd3u0k","updated":"20260626171823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"学校更衣室"}]}]},{"ID":"20260626171820-e1yc7ne","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260626171820-e1yc7ne","updated":"20260626171820"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260626171820-m3uidbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626171820-m3uidbd","updated":"20260626172156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"A的家，中心是一个餐桌（这个不用画，到时候用模型，把位置留出来就行），整体比较破，背景有电动车，笔记本电脑，以及两个相框（一个是年轻夫妻，即A的父母，一个是十多年后的的父子，即A和父亲）"}]}]},{"ID":"20260626172001-mlu1hro","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260626172001-mlu1hro","updated":"20260626172001"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260626172001-f8wwqrt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626172001-f8wwqrt","updated":"20260626172116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"整座高塔的超长背景（可以偷懒重复拼接几次）"}]}]},{"ID":"20260626172159-aojmxp3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260626172159-aojmxp3","updated":"20260626172159"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260626172159-3qm5dv7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626172159-3qm5dv7","updated":"20260626172210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"塔的顶部内外，具体来讲有一个不怎么长的延伸平台，里面风格还是塔，外边是星空和下面城市的光亮"}]}]},{"ID":"20260626172213-ntnaaco","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260626172213-ntnaaco","updated":"20260626172213"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260626172213-d3t35le","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626172213-d3t35le","updated":"20260626172231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地下室场景，比较有巫师地下室那种破败且带点邪性的感觉，色调脏黄一些"}]}]},{"ID":"20260626172231-z7wfbfr","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260626172231-z7wfbfr","updated":"20260626180224"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260626172231-t00cvgv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626172231-t00cvgv","updated":"20260626180224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"家门口的街道（美国贫困区街道，简而言之就是比中国农村宽敞一点，房子更大点），左上角的背景把那座高塔画上"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260626172328-m3li73x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260626172328-m3li73x","updated":"20260626172511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"插画图"}]},{"ID":"20260626172408-5velumq","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260626172408-5velumq","updated":"20260626172501"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260626172501-a7d4kny","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260626172501-a7d4kny","updated":"20260626172501"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260626172501-lt4ztdp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626172501-lt4ztdp","updated":"20260626172501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一座高塔从地面向上仰视的“全身”图"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260626172457-48699pa","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260626172457-48699pa","updated":"20260626172511"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260626172502-fz4af2t","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260626172502-fz4af2t","updated":"20260626172511"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260626172502-zq741ky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626172502-zq741ky","updated":"20260626172511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从塔顶向下看城市的俯视图"}]}]}]}]}